IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPARQ-V3.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-HEADS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TILES-PER-HEAD      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TOTAL-TILES         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 LATENCY-NS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPARQ-V3.
    IF NUM-HEADS == 0 OR TILES-PER-HEAD == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-HEADS TO TOTAL-TILES.
    MULTIPLY TILES-PER-HEAD BY TOTAL-TILES.
    MOVE 48 TO LATENCY-NS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOTAL-TILES.
    WEIGHT 30 LATENCY-NS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
